      "content": "i dont want to take a step back, i want it to stop. the shame is just constant. i feel like i'm just a ghost walking around a campus where i don't belong anymore. if the work is gone, then what am i even here for? it feels like i've reached the end of my utility. like there's no point in trying to rebuild when the foundation is just broken. does it even make sense to keep going when everything you built turns out to be a lie?",
